      "id": "claim_588382e6657c4b08935cd3ff9fb00fa2",
      "statement": "loadBrijioEnv resolves the env file from a three-tier chain (BRIJIO_ENV_FILE, <cwd>/.env, ~/.brijio/.env) in priority order, and applyBrijioEnv copies file values into process.env only for keys that are unset or blank, so explicit environment variables always override the file.",
