      "id": "claim_1be82c520a5840f2a8132c4cb5e30cec",
      "statement": "When BRIJIO_PAIRING_TOKEN and MCP_HTTP_AUTH_TOKEN are unset the binary auto-generates them with randomBytes(32).toString('base64url'); the pairing token is mirrored onto legacy BROWSERBRIDGE_PAIRING_TOKEN, and provided-vs-ephemeral status is tracked for banner/print-config annotation.",
