      "id": "claim_95fe61b512314285931c497d1dc22722",
      "statement": "detectNetworkPaths probes Tailscale via `tailscale status --json` (2s timeout, preferring a 100.64.0.0/10 address), falls back to scanning os.networkInterfaces() for a 100.64.0.0/10 address when the CLI is absent, resolves <hostname>.local via dns.resolve for mDNS, and ranks reachable hosts Tailscale > mDNS > localhost; detection is best-effort and does not relax the bearer-token auth requirement.",
